## X11/Xwayland stack (built by build-xwayland.sh, 2026-10-02)

All sources are pinned under sources/downloads and verified by SHA-256 in
build-xwayland.sh. They build for bionic x86_64 with NDK r30/API 35 into
xstage/x86_64; nothing upstream is patched (bionic gaps are handled by
build glue: an empty libpthread archive, a values.h shim, and pkg-config
mirroring of libgcrypt). Licenses are MIT/HPND-style per project; freetype
is used under its FTL (BSD-style) license option.

